## Output Format

### Synthesized Recommendations (UPDATED)

For each recommendation:
- **ID:** rec-XXX
- **Title:** [Concise]
- **Priority:** [critical/high/medium/low]
- **Expert Support:** X/{{ experts|length }} experts (High/Partial/Low)
- **Description:** [What changed]
- **Evolution:** [From iter {{ iteration - 1 }}: gained support / lost support / new / unchanged]

### Convergence Analysis

- **Current:** X%
- **Previous:** [From previous iteration]%
- **Trend:** 📈 Improving / 📉 Declining / ➡️ Stable
- **Consensus:** ✅ Reached / ❌ Not reached

### Synthesized Questions (If Any)

Questions for next iteration:
- **ID:** q-XXX
- **Question:** [Clear, specific]
- **Why:** [Context]
- **Priority:** [high/medium/low]
- **Source:** [Which experts asked]

### Decision Signal

Choose ONE:
- ✅ **CONTINUE**: Consensus reached (≥80%), ready for artifact
- 🔄 **REFINE**: More iteration needed (convergence < 80%)
- ⚠️ **BLOCKED**: Unanswered questions must be addressed first

